        "description": "SKT Photo World is suitable for photographers, business, commercial, corporates, blogging, portfolio and personal use. Images define and help one visualize more than words and that is what happens when someone uses our theme. Set your website on top of this beautiful theme displaying your primary full width images on the home page slider. Easy to use theme options make it super simple for someone to set up this theme in no time. Compatibility with WooCommerce makes it e-commerce ready. Also compatible with contact form 7. Demo link: https://sktthemesdemo.net/photoworldpro/"
